  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0 adds strict configuration-driven Azure Managed Identity selection through AuthType and ManagedIdentityClientId. Managed Identity configuration no longer requires or retains ClientId, ClientSecret, or TenantId, while existing Azure AD/ADFS configuration and legacy detection remain supported. There is no authentication fallback. Authentication guide: https://github.com/FlintsLabs/FlintsLabs.D365.ODataClient/blob/main/docs/v2/authentication-and-parallelism.md",
